# mfaw — Full Implementation Specification

> Single source of truth for building `mfaw` (Multi-Framework Agentic Workspace).
> A pip-installable, cross-platform, two-layer agent-asset manager.
> Inspired by AW (`~/.aw-ecc`), redesigned for Python packaging, Windows safety,
> and reversible installs.

